<section class="core-values" aria-labelledby="core-values-heading">
    <div class="core-values__inner">
        <h2 id="core-values-heading" class="core-values__title">Mission, vision &amp; core values</h2>
        <p class="core-values__intro">
            Synergy Solutions Training is built on a clear north star—better business worldwide—and the principles that guide how we show up every day.
        </p>

        <div class="core-values__pillar-grid">
            <article class="core-values__pillar core-values__pillar--mission" aria-labelledby="core-values-mission">
                <span class="core-values__pillar-watermark" aria-hidden="true">M</span>
                <h3 id="core-values-mission" class="core-values__pillar-label">Mission</h3>
                <p class="core-values__pillar-text">
                    Synergy Solutions Training is committed to actively enhancing the quality of business around the globe—through practical leadership development, stronger teams, and cultures where people can do their best work.
                </p>
            </article>
            <article class="core-values__pillar core-values__pillar--vision" aria-labelledby="core-values-vision">
                <span class="core-values__pillar-watermark" aria-hidden="true">V</span>
                <h3 id="core-values-vision" class="core-values__pillar-label">Vision</h3>
                <p class="core-values__pillar-text">
                    To bring synergy to all business relationships while achieving breakthroughs and turning what was once considered impossible into everyday success—partnerships built on trust, clarity, and shared momentum.
                </p>
            </article>
        </div>

        <h3 class="core-values__values-heading">Our core values</h3>
        <ul class="core-values__grid">
            <li class="core-values__card" data-accent="1">
                <span class="core-values__card-mark" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
                <h4 class="core-values__card-title">Continuous learning</h4>
                <p class="core-values__card-text">
                    Growth never stops. We model curiosity, deliberate practice, and the willingness to update our thinking—so leaders and teams stay relevant in a world that keeps changing.
                </p>
            </li>
            <li class="core-values__card" data-accent="2">
                <span class="core-values__card-mark" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
                <h4 class="core-values__card-title">Faith</h4>
                <p class="core-values__card-text">
                    Our work is anchored in faith as a source of purpose, humility, and service. It reminds us that leadership is stewardship—and that people always come before processes.
                </p>
            </li>
            <li class="core-values__card" data-accent="3">
                <span class="core-values__card-mark" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
                <h4 class="core-values__card-title">Family</h4>
                <p class="core-values__card-text">
                    We honor family as a priority, not a footnote. Sustainable achievement includes healthy boundaries and relationships—at home and at work—so energy and commitment stay authentic.
                </p>
            </li>
            <li class="core-values__card" data-accent="4">
                <span class="core-values__card-mark" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
                <h4 class="core-values__card-title">Innovation</h4>
                <p class="core-values__card-text">
                    We challenge assumptions, experiment thoughtfully, and translate ideas into behavior—not slogans. Innovation here means practical creativity that moves teams forward.
                </p>
            </li>
            <li class="core-values__card" data-accent="5">
                <span class="core-values__card-mark" aria-hidden="true">05</span>
                <h4 class="core-values__card-title">Integrity</h4>
                <p class="core-values__card-text">
                    We say what we mean, deliver what we promise, and own our mistakes. Trust is built in small moments—follow-through, honesty, and consistency especially when it costs something.
                </p>
            </li>
            <li class="core-values__card" data-accent="6">
                <span class="core-values__card-mark" aria-hidden="true">06</span>
                <h4 class="core-values__card-title">Passion</h4>
                <p class="core-values__card-text">
                    Energy and care show up in every engagement. We invest fully because outcomes matter—to your people, your customers, and the standards you set for your culture.
                </p>
            </li>
            <li class="core-values__card" data-accent="7">
                <span class="core-values__card-mark" aria-hidden="true">07</span>
                <h4 class="core-values__card-title">Transparency</h4>
                <p class="core-values__card-text">
                    Clear expectations, candid feedback, and open dialogue reduce friction and fear. When people know where they stand, they can align, improve, and contribute with confidence.
                </p>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</section>
